Z||000006||LarryB||01-08-2001||05:16 AM||||Raydar, I work for a carrier although I'm on the IP side. We have 1630, 1631, 1633, and 1680 at my facility so my eyes locked on when I read "Alcatel" + "Richardson TX".  Our entry techs get 1631 and 1633 training as a minimum when they're ready for it.<P>My employer has its share of idiots but fortunately none locally, in my direct chain of command, or in strategic positions.  It's a lot safer to yell at some bozo when he or she is 1800 miles away too.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Ties? Yeech.  Had to do that before.  Don't ever want to again. <P>||||reg||6
